ubMed", "id": "19737927"}], "value": "E3 ubiquitin-protein ligase. Mediates monoubiquitination at multiple sites of TSG101 in the presence of UBE2D1, but not of UBE2G1, nor UBE2H (PubMed:17229889, PubMed:19703557). Plays a role in the regulation of endosome-to-lysosome trafficking (PubMed:17229889). Impairs MC1R- and MC4R-signaling by competing with GNAS-binding to MCRs and inhibiting agonist-induced cAMP production (PubMed:19737927). Does not inhibit ADRB2-signaling (PubMed:19737927). Does not promote MC1R ubiquitination (PubMed:19737927). Acts also as a negative regulator of hedgehog signaling (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"commentType": "CATALYTIC ACTIVITY", "reaction": {"name": "S-ubiquitinyl-[E2 ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme]-L-cysteine + [acceptor protein]-L-lysine = [E2 ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme]-L-cysteine + N(6)-ubiquitinyl-[acceptor protein]-L-lysine.", "ecNumber": "2.3.2.27"}}, {"texts": [{"value": "Protein modification; protein ubiquitination"}], "commentType": "PATHWAY"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q9D074"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17229889"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "19737927"}], "value": "Interacts with MC1R and MC4R, but not with TBXA2R (PubMed:19737927). Interacts with TSG101 (PubMed:17229889). Interacts with mislocalized cytosolically exposed PRNP; this interaction alters MGRN1 subcellular location and causes lysosomal enlargement (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O60291", "intActId": "EBI-2129851"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q99816", "geneName": "TSG101", "intActId": "EBI-346882"}, "numberOfExperiments": 5, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "note": {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17229889"}], "va